Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fscx0\fscy0\clip(0,0,0,0)}Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode.\NSubtitles will likely not function properly.\NPlease use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv:\Nhttps://mpv.io
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\org(0,0)\fscx0\fscy0\clip(0,0,0,0)}Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode.\NSubtitles will likely not function properly.\NPlease use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv:\Nhttps://mpv.io
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{I wonder if it's not gonna snow anymore. - OG}I wonder if it'll snow again.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{There's no way it would. - OG}Why would it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.03,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{Oh, it will. You don't know since\Nyou slept through it last time. - OG}It just does. You don't know\N'cause you slept through it.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.87,0:02:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think it'll snow again?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.79,0:02:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1020)}{It could snow, but the sea \Nwe were in first is special... -OG}{It could snow, but the sea\Nwhere we first sailed was special. - Z}It's a possibility, but that\Nfirst stretch of sea was special.{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.42,0:02:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{since the seven magnetic forces from\N Reverse Mountain mess it all up. - OG}The seven magnetic fields from\NReverse Mountain wreak havoc on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{That doesn't mean you can relax your attention here, though. - OG}However, you shouldn't\Nlet down your guard here, either.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{It'd be rare for this sea\Nto be wild like where we first sailed, - OG}Rarely is this sea as rough\Nas where we first set sail...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.94,0:02:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{but there's no doubt that this sea is a lot harsher than ordinary ones. - OG}{but it's still true that this sea is a lot more difficult than ordinary ones. - Z}but the fact remains: This sea is\Nmuch harsher than ordinary waters.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{Never underestimate it. - OG}Never underestimate these seas.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the ironclad rule.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.40,0:02:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{Wanna have my special drink? - OG}Wanna try a special drink I made?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.54,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.71,0:03:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{Say, Usopp. - OG}Hey, Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{Make a fishing tackle for me. - OG}Make us some fishing gear.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{Fishing, huh? That's a good idea! - OG}Fishing, huh? You might\Nbe on to something!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.72,0:03:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{Okay. Then I'll make a stylish\Nfishing rod for you. - OG}Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{Okay. Then I'll make a stylish\Nfishing rod for you. - OG}I'll even make 'em\Nnice and stylish for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.10,0:03:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{Wow, you sure can drink.\NHey, is it good? - OG}Wow, you sure can put them away.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{Wow, you sure can drink.\NHey, is it good? - OG}So, is it any good?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.19,0:03:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.81,0:03:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You're amazing, Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{Is this really okay?! - OG}How is any of this okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{Here, this is for you. - OG}Here. For you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.53,0:03:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.03,0:03:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{I think it's fine. - OG}It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.45,0:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{They'll work hard if it storms...\Nsince they don't wanna die. - OG}They'll pick up the pace in a squall.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{They'll work hard if it storms...\Nsince they don't wanna die. - OG}They want to stay alive too.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.83,0:03:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{That's true, but it makes me feel\Nlike I'm worked up over nothing. - OG}{Good point. Then am I\Ngetting worked up over nothing? - Z}I suppose.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{That's true, but it makes me feel\Nlike I'm worked up over nothing. - OG}{Good point. Then am I\Ngetting worked up over nothing? - Z}They just seem so distracted.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.00,0:03:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{This ship makes you forget about all of your worries, doesn't it? - OG}{This ship just washes away\Nall your worries, doesn't it? - Z}As long as you're on this ship,\Nyou won't feel much stress.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Attaboy! Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.85,0:04:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid Karoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yes, it's quite relieving... - OG}{Yes, it's quite relaxing. - Z}Yes, it {\i1}is{\i0} quite relaxing.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey everyone, look!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dolphin!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He's cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's huge! - OG}It's humongous!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.27,0:04:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{Let's run away! - OG}Get a move on!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.02,0:04:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,– Okay!\N– Yep!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.11,0:05:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,644)}All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that side!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.53,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{Got it! - OG}On it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.08,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{Completely unfurl the sails! - OG}Unfurl the sails!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{Okay! Ride the wave\Nand shake him off! - OG}Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.01,0:05:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{Okay! Ride the wave\Nand shake him off! - OG}Ride the wave\Nand lose that dolphin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.61,0:05:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{Nami! Which direction should the ship take? - OG}Nami! What's our next heading?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.28,0:05:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.28,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me check.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{Turn to port, full! - OG}Full turn aport!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.25,0:05:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,– Okay!\N– Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.81,0:06:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{That island and Cactus Island\Nare pulling against each other. - OG}{It's pulling against Cactus Island. - Z}It's linked with Cactus Island.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{Our next stop is... - OG}The next stop on our trip is...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that island!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{So that's the one! - OG}There it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.08,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Our second island in the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.31,0:06:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. 3.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{What is it? Hold on... - OG}What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{What is it? Hold on... - OG}A moment, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.19,0:07:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{There's just nothing like Earl Grey. - OG}{There's nothing quite like Early Grey tea. - Z}No other tea can\Ncompare to Earl Grey.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bored.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.24,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{You say you're bored,\Nbut you don't like working, right? - OG}You insist that you're bored,\Nyet you dislike work, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.29,0:07:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.87,0:07:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{Then, why don't you try enjoying\Nthis joyous free time a little? - OG}In that case, why not try\Nto enjoy this wondrous time off?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.00,0:07:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{Being able to take a long vacation like\N this is a privilege to officer agents. - OG}Extended vacations are a privilege\Nafforded only to officer agents.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{And... - OG}Also,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.76,0:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{stop calling me by my code \Nname in public like this. - OG}{stop calling me by my code\Nname in public like this. - Z}{\an8\q2}you mustn't refer to me\Nby my code name in public.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.22,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{People will find out\Nthat I'm Mr. 3. - OG}People will discover that I'm Mr. 3.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.60,0:07:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.48,0:07:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{By the way, you've been looking\Nat that piece of paper for the past few days. - OG}By the way, you've been staring\Nat that piece of paper for days now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{What on earth is it? - OG}What ever could it be?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,An order from the boss.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{You should've told me sooner! - OG}Why didn't you say so sooner?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.54,0:07:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{Apparently, Mr. 5 has been taken down. - OG}Apparently, Mr. 5 was taken out.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.21,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{Humph! If someone had to get taken down,\NI wish it were someone like Mr. 2. - OG}{Hmph! Though I would've\Nmuch preferred that it were Mr. 2. - Z}I would have preferred\Nseeing Mr. 2 get eliminated.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{Then you could get a promotion. - OG}Then you'd get a promotion, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.88,0:08:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{Mr. 5 being taken down isn't\Nworth making a big deal over. - OG}Mr. 5's defeat isn't worth\Nmaking a fuss over.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.14,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{After all, that man is just an idiot with devil fruit powers, who was overconfident of his own position. - OG}{After all, he was an overambitious fool with devil fruit powers. - Z}Alas, he's simply a novice who\Noverestimated his status and abilities.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.69,0:08:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how amazing\Nthe devil fruit power one gains,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.19,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{if he can't fully utilize it,\Nhis existence is a total waste. - OG}if one can't properly utilize it,\Nthat person's existence is wasted.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.49,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{Superb criminals execute their\Ncrimes using their superb brains. - OG}Only the most superb minds\Nexecute the most superb crimes.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.04,0:08:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{Let's teach whoever beat Mr. 5... - OG}{Why don't we teach whoever did it... - Z}To whomever took him out,\Nwhy don't we reveal{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.04,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(4487,0,1,\c&HF8F9F6&\3c&HF8F9F6&\4c&HF8F9F6&)}{the terror of making \Na criminal organization their enemy. - OG}the terror that comes from defying\Nthis criminal organization?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.89,0:09:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Little Garden!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's "little" about it?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.82,0:09:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This place doesn't\Nquite fit its cute name.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{Ahh... It's like a terra incognita.\NIt's a thick jungle! - OG}I-It's like an uncharted island.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.36,0:09:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{Ahh... It's like a terra incognita.\NIt's a thick jungle! - OG}The jungle's so thick!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.99,0:09:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{We have to be careful. - OG}We'll need to be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.03,0:09:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about what\NMiss All-Sunday was saying.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.87,0:09:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{A-a-are you saying\Na monster may appear?! - OG}L-L-Like a monster might show up?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.25,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{Let's go to our next destination\Nwithout going ashore on this one! - OG}Then at this next stop,\Nlet's stay aboard the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.21,0:09:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{But the log can't be\Nstored so quickly. - OG}Y'know, the log could\Ntake a while to register.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.09,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we have to\Nstock up on food soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.51,0:09:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{We didn't get anything\Nin the last town we were in. - OG}We didn't get anything\Nfrom that last town.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{There's a river mouth there. - OG}{There's a river mouth over there! - Z}There's a river over there!{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.27,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,– What?\N– Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{I hope there's a barbecue\Nrestaurant in here. -OG}I hope there's a barbecue restaurant.{Z- "yakiniku" = "grilled meat"}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.44,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As if there'd be one!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{But you said we were\Ngoing to stock up on food. - OG}What happened to\Nstocking up on food?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.36,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll collect food to cook later!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{Geez, what're you thinking? - OG}Honestly! You got a screw loose?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.70,0:09:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's dangerous to go ashore.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{Just take a look at\Nthe plants here to start with. - OG}For starters,\Ntake a look at these plants.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.21,0:10:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{I've never seen anything like them,\Neven in encyclopedias. -OG}{There's nothing like them\Nin any encyclopedia. - Z}I've never seen those\Nin any encyclopedia.{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{How cute! - OG}You're so cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.64,0:10:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.39,0:10:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{Obviously I meant Nami-[/i1]san[/i0]! - OG}Obviously I meant Nami!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.06,0:10:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{Funi: What was it I just heard? - OG}What was that just now?{Dan}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.23,0:10:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a bird.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is just a jungle.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{What was that for, you damn bird?! - OG}What's your problem,\Nyou damn bird?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{A lizard... I wonder\Nif it tastes good. - OG}A lizard? I wonder if it tastes good.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.88,0:10:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{Is that a kind of noise you\Nhear from just any jungle? - OG}Do jungles normally\Nmake that kind of noise?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.13,0:10:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(3566,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}{That sounded like a volcano erupted! - OG}{That sounded like a volcanic eruption! - Z}That sounded like a volcano!{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.90,0:11:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A tiger?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.61,0:11:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's too huge! - OG}It's way too big!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{What?! What happened?! - OG}What...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{What?! What happened?! - OG}What happened to it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't normal!\NThis is definitely not normal!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.79,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{Why does a tiger, king of the jungle,\Nfall covered in blood?! - OG}Why would a tiger, king of the jungle,\Ncollapse in a bloody heap?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{Ah! It's decided that we're\Nnot gonna go ashore on this island! - OG}It's decided that we're\N{\i1}not{\i0} going ashore!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.64,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{We'll quietly wait on the ship\Nuntil the log is stored and... - OG}We'll wait quietly on the ship,\Nand when the log is ready...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{leave this island as soon as possible. - OG}...we leave this island immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.60,0:11:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.56,0:11:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{W... We have to go\Nto Alabasta quickly... - OG}W-We're in a hurry\Nto get to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.36,0:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{Sanji! Make lunch for me! - OG}Sanji! Lunch!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.24,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunch?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! For replenishing energy! - OG}Yeah! To restore my energy!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.70,0:12:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate lunch with\Nlots of meat and no veggies!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.29,0:12:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{I can smell adventure in the air! - OG}I smell adventure!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.67,0:12:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.21,0:12:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.38,0:12:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.26,0:12:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna come along?\NAdventure! Adventure!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.26,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's useless... I can't stop him.\NHe's too enthusiastic... - OG}It's no use. You can't stop him\Nwhen he gets this enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.14,0:12:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{Unbelievable! - OG}No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.81,0:12:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{There's a monster\Nthat beat up a huge tiger in here! - OG}Somewhere in here is a monster\Nthat beats up huge tigers!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.31,0:12:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{Sanji! Make lunch for me! - OG}Sanji! Lunch!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{Okay. Hold on a bit. - OG}You got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.85,0:12:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{Okay. Hold on a bit. - OG}Coming right up.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{Say, can I come with you? - OG}Say, do you mind if I come along?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.94,0:12:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{Sure! Come, come! - OG}Sure! C'mon! C'mon!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you too!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.70,0:12:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah... If I just sit around here,\NI may start thinking about all sorts of things. -OG}Indeed.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.70,0:12:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah... If I just sit around here,\NI may start thinking about all sorts of things. -OG}If I stay here,\NI might begin to brood.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'll go out to take my mind off\Nthings until the log is stored. - OG}Exploring will distract me\Nuntil the log sets.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.21,0:12:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{No way! It may be okay for Luffy,\Nbut it's too dangerous for you! - OG}No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{No way! It may be okay for Luffy,\Nbut it's too dangerous for you! - OG}Luffy going is one thing,\Nbut it's too risky for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'll be fine.\NKaroo will be with me. - OG}I'll be fine. I'll have Karoo by my side.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.84,0:13:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{He's too shocked\Nto say a word, though. - OG}His face tells\Na different story, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.55,0:13:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{Then, I'll make a \N"love lunch" for Vivi-chan. - OG}{Dan: Maintaining the "pirate lunch" continuity...although it goes nowhere lol}{\q2}Then Vivi gets a sweetheart lunch.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.14,0:13:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{Could you also prepare\Nsomething to drink for Karoo? - OG}Could you also prepare\Na drink for Karoo?{Dan: Added "also"}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{Please leave it to me! - OG}Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.53,0:13:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.41,0:13:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now then. Two "pirate lunches"\Nand a special drink for Karoo. -OG}So! That's two pirate lunches\Nand a very special drink for Karoo.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.75,0:13:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all set.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.04,0:13:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then. See you later!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back in a little while!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.76,0:13:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Wednesday sure is brave.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.18,0:13:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{As may be expected from someone who\Ninfiltrated an enemy organization. - OG}{As expected from someone\Nwho infiltrated an enemy organization. - Z}She did infiltrate an enemy\Norganization, after all.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.23,0:13:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{Well, I'm bored too,\Nso I'll go take a walk. - OG}Well, I'm bored too.\NI'm going for a walk.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.11,0:13:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{Take a walk?! - OG}A walk?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.11,0:14:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.61,0:14:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{We're short of food. - OG}We're short on food.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.49,0:14:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{If you see animals that appear\Nedible, bring them back. - OG}If you see an animal that\Nlooks edible, bring it back.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.45,0:14:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.29,0:14:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'll bring back one that\Nyou can't possibly capture. - OG}{I'll find one that even you\Ncouldn't possibly capture. - Z}I'll find one that you\Ncouldn't possibly capture.{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{Wait, you bastard! - OG}Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.46,0:14:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.09,0:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{I can't let that remark go unchallenged! - OG}I can't just let that challenge slide!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.51,0:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{You can capture a bigger one\Nthan I can, you say?! - OG}So you think you can\Nnab a bigger one than me?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.89,0:14:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.98,0:14:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{Then, it's a hunting match. - OG}You're on, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.07,0:14:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{Look! We'll compete over\Nhow many kilos of meat we get. - OG}{Look! The winner brings back\Nthe most kilograms of meat. - Z}Look! He who collects\Nthe most kilograms of meat wins.{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{Didn't you mean\Nto say how many tons? - OG}Don't you mean to say tons?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{You can talk cocky once \Nyou've brought back some prey. - OG}{Save the attitude for when you've\Nbrought something back. - Z}Save the attitude for when\Nyou've caught something.{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'll take you up on that! - OG}Sounds fair to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.16,0:14:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{I wonder... why they're all like that? - OG}I wonder. Why do they\Nall turn out this way?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{I understand how you feel. - OG}I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.71,0:14:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't cry. I'm on your side. - OG}No need to cry.\NI'm with you on this.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.38,0:15:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{We're sitting ducks. - OG}I'm screwed.{I dunno how to phrase this with the limited time the line has, but the idea is that Usopp can't depend on Nami for protection. I figure him looking at her is enough to convey the idea.}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's my line!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.44,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-Wh-What's the matter?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.19,0:15:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,N-N-N-Nami?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.11,0:15:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{This isn't it... - OG}This isn't it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't it, either.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ow, ow! H-Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.49,0:15:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! Hey! What the heck\Nare you looking for?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.37,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember reading about it in a book.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,About... About what?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Garden.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.87,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{Oops! - OG}Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.54,0:15:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{What's the matter? - OG}What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.54,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, look at this!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{There's a shellfish like a squid. - OG}There's a shellfish, but it's like a squid.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A squid shellfish!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.09,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks a lot like an ammonite.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's a squid shellfish, right? - OG}So, a squid shellfish?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.49,0:16:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{I feel like someone's been\Nfollowing me for a while... - OG}Why do I get the feeling\NI'm being followed?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{Well, it must be my imagination. - OG}Just my imagination.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.59,0:16:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{How dare you mess with me! - OG}Don't screw with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.84,0:16:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Collier Shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.36,0:16:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this...?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it edible?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one was it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{I think I read it recently,\Nbut it slipped my mind. - OG}I swear I read it recently,\Nbut it must have slipped my mind.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.67,0:17:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{Oh?\NWhy is there a sea king on land? - OG}Hey...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.59,0:17:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{Oh?\NWhy is there a sea king on land? - OG}Why is there a sea king on land?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.64,0:17:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.60,0:17:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{Then, this is an ancient island! - OG}Then, this is a prehistoric island!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.43,0:17:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.45,0:17:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{The land here is stuck\Nin the time of the dinosaurs! - OG}This island hasn't progressed\Npast the time of the dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.55,0:17:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.52,0:17:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{Since there were no exchanges\Namong islands in the Grand Line - OG}Trade and culture exchange\Non the Grand Line is very rare,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.86,0:17:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{due to the difficulties with sea travel, - OG}due to the harshness\Nof sea travel here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.49,0:17:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{each one established its unique culture. - OG}Thus, each island establishes\Nits own unique culture.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.83,0:17:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{There are islands that have\Nan extremely sophisticated culture... - OG}Some islands have\Nbecome incredibly advanced,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.75,0:17:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{and there are some others\Nthat remain in the same form - OG}and there are others\Nthat remain unchanged,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.25,0:17:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{without progressing for several thousand\Nor tens of thousands years... - OG}their progress halted for thousands,\Nno, {\i1}tens{\i0} of thousands of years.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.51,0:17:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{The nonsensical climate in the Grand Line makes it possible. - OG}It's all thanks to the Grand Line's\Nnonsensical climate.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.18,0:18:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{That's why this island exists\Nin the dinosaur time. - OG}That is why this island is stuck\Nin the age of the dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.89,0:18:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{Don't jump on it! - OG}Don't leap to it!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.15,0:18:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.24,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.99,0:18:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.78,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find the book?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.74,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,On this island...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.03,0:18:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{It felt like Nami-san\Njust called me... - OG}It felt like Nami\Njust called out to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.37,0:19:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{To those residents,\Nthis island is as if a "little garden." - OG}{\i1}To those residing here,\N{\q2}this island is naught but a little garden.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.38,0:19:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Little Garden...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.59,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{That's what I'll call this place. - OG}is what I shall name this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Louis Arnote, Explorer.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.15,0:19:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.61,0:19:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{What's the answer? - OG}What do you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.45,0:19:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.07,0:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Could you repeat that?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{I asked you if you\Nhave any alcohol. - OG}I asked if you have any booze.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.58,0:19:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{We've got a little left... - OG}We don't have much left...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{So you've got some? - OG}So then, you {\i1}do{\i0} have some!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.21,0:19:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{I-it's not for drinking.\NIt's for cooking and disinfection. - OG}Wh-What we have isn't for drinking,\Njust cooking and disinfecting.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.63,0:19:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{But if you like,\Nwe'll give it all to you. - OG}But if you'd like, you can have it all.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.23,0:20:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.39,0:20:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.79,0:20:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Brogy, Elbaph's strongest warrior!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.71,0:20:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now I've got meat, too.\NI'll treat you, my guests. - OG}Now I've got meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{Now I've got meat, too.\NI'll treat you, my guests. - OG}Allow me to treat you as my guests.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Pretend we're dead,\Nn-no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.98,0:20:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Doesn't pretending to be dead\Nonly work on b-bears?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.62,0:21:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.79,0:21:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great view!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.41,0:21:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{I wanna have lunch here. - OG}I wanna have my lunch up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.42,0:21:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is {\i1}not{\i0}\Nthe time for idle chatter!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.17,0:21:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So there really {\i1}are{\i0} volcanoes.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's a mountain\Nwith huge holes as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.39,0:21:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down already!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.11,0:21:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been eaten!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.49,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.11,0:22:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.33,0:22:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was watching.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.62,0:22:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Grappling longnecks in the jungle...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.87,0:22:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lively human!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.79,0:22:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{You're the first guest in a long time. - OG}You're my first guest in a long time.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.29,0:22:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're huge! Are you a human?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.42,0:22:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Dorry, Elbaph's strongest warrior!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A... A giant!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.52,0:22:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard of them, but this is my\Nfirst time actually seeing one.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.31,0:22:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy. I'm a pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.44,0:23:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate?! Good for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.40,0:23:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.91,0:23:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{We're getting out of here while we can! - OG}Let's run while we can!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.99,0:23:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{Oh yeah, the ones over there are\NVivi and Karoo. Nice to meet you! - OG}Oh yeah, those two over there\Nare Vivi and Karoo. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.20,0:23:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{Luffy-[/i1]san[/i0]just[/i1]had[/i0]\Nto open his big mouth. - OG}Luffy just {\i1}had{\i0}\Nto open his big mouth.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.63,0:23:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{I'll invite you guys to my home! - OG}Let me invite you to my place!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.11,0:23:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, eat!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.53,0:23:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{Dinosaur meat tastes good. - OG}Dinosaur meat is tasty.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{I-I have no appetite. - OG}I-I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.37,0:23:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.29,0:23:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,– I don't want to eat...\N– I don't want to eat...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.96,0:24:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{Dinosaur meat tastes good,\NI'm tellin' ya... - OG}But dinosaur meat is\Nreal tasty. I'm tellin' you.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.84,0:24:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{Is he trying to get us to eat\Nthe dinosaur meat first - OG}Is he gonna make us\Neat the dinosaur meat...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{in order to fatten\Nus up a little - OG}...just to fatten us up a bit...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then eat {\i1}us{\i0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.72,0:24:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, he's acting like\Na giant, all right. - OG}Yup. This is textbook giant, all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.60,0:24:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{When we're still so young... - OG}But we're still so young.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.02,0:24:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{Maybe we taste best when we're young... - OG}{Maybe we're at peak flavor. - Gaijin}Then maybe we're at peak flavor.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.64,0:24:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.36,0:24:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good, I'm tellin' you...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.36,0:24:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{If we somehow keep fasting until\Nthe log is stored and don't get fat, - OG}If we manage to fast\Nuntil the log is registered,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.53,0:24:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{we may be able to survive... - OG}we might stay thin enough to survive.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.61,0:24:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{But how long will it take\Nfor the log to be stored? - OG}But how long will it take\Nfor the log to finish?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.41,0:24:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{If I don't eat for three days, I'm sure I'll get tempted by this smell of meat and eat it... - OG}After a three-day fast, I'll succumb\Nto this meat's amazing aroma.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.54,0:24:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{Brogy-[/i1]san[/i0]!\NCan I ask you a question? - OG}Brogy, can I ask you a question?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.13,0:24:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{What's the matter, young lady? - OG}What is it, little miss?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.97,0:24:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{H-How long will it take for the log\Nof this island to be stored? - OG}H-How long will it take\Nfor this island's log to register?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.64,0:24:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,One year.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.51,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.47,0:25:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no... There's no way\Nwe can fast for a year...!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.23,0:25:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{I... definitely can't help eating... - OG}I... definitely won't keep from eating.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.65,0:25:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, make yourselves at home!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.00,0:25:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is yummy, giant old guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.75,0:25:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{Your pirate lunch thing tastes good, too, - OG}{So is that "pirate lunch" of yours, - Z}That "pirate lunch" of yours was, too,{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.13,0:25:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{although it's a little too small for me. - OG}though it was a little small for me.{Gaijin}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.97,0:25:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{Of course it's good! - OG}You bet it's good!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.80,0:25:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a special lunch the chef\Non my pirate ship made.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.35,0:25:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{If you say it's bad, NI'll beat you up! - OG}Badmouth it, and I'll beat you up.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.06,0:25:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{Beat me up, you said? - OG}Beat me up, you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.19,0:25:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{What a funny squirt you are! - OG}You're a riot, kid!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.69,0:25:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-They're becoming awfully friendly.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.44,0:25:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, why are you\Nliving here alone, old guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.40,0:25:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a village or something?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.74,0:25:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.87,0:25:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There {\i1}is{\i0} a village.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.49,0:25:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a warriors' village called Elbaph.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.49,0:26:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's somewhere in the Grand Line. - OG}It's elsewhere in the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.12,0:26:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are rules in the village.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.92,0:26:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.59,0:26:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{For example, if there's a fight in\Nthe village and neither side give up, - OG}For example, if a fight breaks out\Nand neither party concedes,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.05,0:26:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{we are judged by Elbaph's god. - OG}the gods of Elbaph intercede\Nwith their judgment.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.30,0:26:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{Elbaph's god always gives divine\Nprotection to the righteous one - OG}Elbaph's gods favor one party\Nwith divine protection in battle,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.64,0:26:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{and lets the righteous one survive. - OG}and thus the victor is deemed correct.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.64,0:26:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{Elbaph's gods, huh? - OG}Elbaph's gods, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.98,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{I caused a disturbance myself - OG}I once started such a fight,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.60,0:26:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{now this island is the battleground\N between a certain man and I. - OG}and now this island hosts a duel\Nbetween another man and me.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.94,0:26:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{The righteous one will win\Nthe duel and survive. - OG}One of us will survive,\Nso that man will be correct.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.61,0:26:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{But we haven't been able to\Nsettle this for about 100 years. - OG}But even after 100 years,\Nthe matter still isn't settled!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.95,0:26:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have been fighting\Nfor 100 years?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.00,0:26:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{It's nothing surprising, - OG}No surprise there.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.25,0:26:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{since our life span is at least three times as long as yours. - OG}Our lifespan is at least\Nthree times as long as yours.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.30,0:26:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{Even if it's three times, - OG}Three times or otherwise,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.09,0:26:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{your interest in fighting would\Nwane in 100 years, wouldn't it? - OG}wouldn't the fighting\Nwane after 100 years?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{Is there any point in\Ncontinuing to fight? - OG}Why would you\Ncarry on for so long?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.76,0:26:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a duel to the death, right?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.10,0:27:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.44,0:27:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{That's a huge volcano eruption! - OG}That's a huge eruption!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.90,0:27:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, time to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.74,0:27:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.66,0:27:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.91,0:27:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,An eruption...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.79,0:27:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.33,0:27:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.30,0:27:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{His face suddenly got tense... - OG}He suddenly got so serious.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.63,0:27:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to head out for a bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.85,0:27:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Head out?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.27,0:27:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. That was a signal for the duel\Nthat I've been in for 100 years. - OG}Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.06,0:27:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. That was a signal for the duel\Nthat I've been in for 100 years. - OG}That was the signal for me\Nto continue my 100-year duel.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.73,0:27:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A duel?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.11,0:27:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,W-With whom? Where?!\NAnd for what reason?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.28,0:27:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Reason?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.11,0:27:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.03,0:28:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{It became our routine\Nbefore we realized it. - OG}Before we realized it,\Nit had become routine.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.41,0:28:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The eruption of the central mountain\Nis the signal for the duel.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.17,0:28:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{To have such hatred that you'd try killing each other for 100 years is... - OG}Locked in a death match\N{\q2}for 100 years, and with such hatred...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.30,0:28:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world caused this fight?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.13,0:28:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.38,0:28:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.48,0:28:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{Right. It's because of our pride. - OG}Right. It's a matter of pride!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.24,0:28:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot the reason...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.66,0:28:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,a long time ago!
